---
layout: layouts/blog.njk
title: Blog — Dare Pong
description: Party-Tipps, Spielregeln und alles rund um Beer Pong und Dare Pong.
permalink: /blog/
---

<div class="blog-index">
  <div class="blog-index__header">
    <div class="container">
      <span class="eyebrow">Blog</span>
      <h1 class="blog-index__title">Party-Wissen.<br>Direkt aus Bremen.</h1>
      <p class="blog-index__lede">Spielregeln, Trinkspieltipps und alles, was Eure nächste Runde unvergesslich macht.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="container">
    <div class="blog-index__grid">
      {% for post in collections.posts %}
      <a href="{{ post.url | url }}" class="post-card">
        {% if post.data.image %}
        <div class="post-card__img">
          {% responsiveImage post.data.image, (post.data.imageAlt or post.data.title), "(max-width: 600px) 100vw, 400px" %}
        </div>
        {% else %}
        <div class="post-card__img post-card__img--placeholder">
          <svg width="48" height="56" viewBox="0 0 120 140" aria-hidden="true">
            <ellipse cx="60" cy="34" rx="44" ry="8" fill="#FFF7E3" opacity=".4"/>
            <path d="M22 34 L98 34 L88 130 L32 130 Z" fill="#E1342B" opacity=".4"/>
            <path d="M22 34 L98 34 L96 42 L24 42 Z" fill="#B82822" opacity=".4"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        {% endif %}
        <div class="post-card__body">
          {% if post.data.tags %}
          <div class="post-card__tags">
            {% for tag in post.data.tags %}
            {% if tag != "post" %}
            <span class="post-card__tag">{{ tag }}</span>
            {% endif %}
            {% endfor %}
          </div>
          {% endif %}
          <h2 class="post-card__title">{{ post.data.title }}</h2>
          {% if post.data.summary %}
          <p class="post-card__summary">{{ post.data.summary }}</p>
          {% endif %}
          <div class="post-card__meta">
            <time datetime="{{ post.date | dateISO }}">{{ post.date | dateDE }}</time>
            <span class="post-card__arrow">&rarr;</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </a>
      {% else %}
      <p class="blog-index__empty">Bald kommen neue Artikel. Schau wieder vorbei!</p>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
